  "result": "Excellent! All 236 tests pass. The VAT summary feature is complete.\n\n## Summary\n\nAdded `vatSummary(invoices)` function to `src/reports.js` that:\n\n- Filters invoices with status 'issued', 'partially_paid', or 'paid'\n- Groups line items by VAT rate\n- Returns array of `{ rate, base, vat }` objects where:\n  - `rate` is the VAT percentage (0, 9, 21, etc.)\n  - `base` is the sum of line totals after discounts at that rate\n  - `vat` is the sum of VAT amounts calculated at that rate\n- Sorts results by VAT rate descending (high to low)\n\nAdded 14 comprehensive tests covering:\n- Empty invoices\n- Draft invoice exclusion\n- Including issued/partially paid/paid invoices\n- Base and VAT calculations\n- Multiple invoices aggregation\n- Multiple VAT rates\n- Correct sorting\n- Interaction with line discounts and tier discounts\n- Status filtering",
